# E-commerce Customer Retention and Cohort Analysis

This repository contains a complete end-to-end project focused on e-commerce retention, customer cohorts, and repeat purchase analysis.

## Business objective

Identify which customer segments generate repeat revenue and which cohorts are at risk of churn. The project demonstrates how to analyze retention using SQL and Python, and how to present the story using dashboards.

## Dataset

The repository includes a synthetic e-commerce dataset modeled to match typical retail behavior:
- customers
- orders
- order_items
- products

## Analytics included

- Monthly revenue and order trends
- New vs returning customers
- Repeat purchase rate
- Average order value (AOV)
- Customer lifetime value (CLV)
- Cohort retention matrix
- Top products by repeat-purchase rate
- RFM segmentation

