## Quick start

1. Install Python dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

2. Generate the sample dataset:

```bash
python data/generate_sample_data.py
```

3. Load the data into PostgreSQL/MySQL/SQLite.

4. Run the SQL scripts in order:

```bash
psql -U postgres -d ecommerce -f sql/01_customer_metrics.sql
psql -U postgres -d ecommerce -f sql/02_cohort_analysis.sql
psql -U postgres -d ecommerce -f sql/03_rfm_segmentation.sql
```

5. Open the notebook in Jupyter to explore the results.

